{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"cancelAll","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"()","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you add a task to a group after canceling the group,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that task is canceled immediately after being added to the group."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Immediately canceled child tasks should therefore cooperatively check for and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"react  to cancellation, e.g. by throwing an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CancellationError"},{"type":"text","text":" at their"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"earliest convenience, or otherwise handling the cancellation."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"There are no restrictions on where you can call this method.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Code inside a child task or even another task can cancel a group,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"however one should be very careful to not keep a reference to the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"group longer than the ","type":"text"},{"code":"with...TaskGroup(...) { ... }","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" method body is executing.","type":"text"}]},{"style":"note","name":"See Also","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Task.isCancelled"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside"},{"style":"note","name":"See Also","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ThrowingDiscardingTaskGroup.isCancelled"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside"}]}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Cancel all of